                "description": "The Orb Knob with Disk Rosette is one of those classic combinations that fits so effortlessly into traditional decors. This Traditional Ball Knobset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.  It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from a wide selection of beautiful finishes.",
